### Goal Model Summary

| Goal ID | Goal Title | Goal Text | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation | Justification |
|--------|------------|-----------|--------------------|-----------|----------|---------------|
| G1     | Fulfill Resource Request | Ensure resources are collected from storage and delivered to the specified location. | # (parallel) | Achieve | - | The mission requires both collection and delivery to be done in parallel. |
| G2     | Collect Resources from Storage | Gather required resources from storage locations. | FALLBACK(AT1, G2.1) | Perform | OR with G1 | Collection and delivery can be done in parallel. |
| G3     | Deliver Resources to Destination | Transport resources to the specified location. | FALLBACK(AT2, G3.1) | Perform | OR with G1 | Same as G2. |
| G2.1   | Battery Monitoring during Collection | Ensure battery level remains above 10%. | - | Query | AND with G2 | Battery must be monitored during collection. |
| G3.1   | Battery Monitoring during Delivery | Ensure battery level remains above 30%. | - | Query | AND with G3 | Battery must be monitored during delivery. |

### Task Model Summary

| Task ID | Task Title | Task Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots | Justification |
|---------|------------|-----------|----------|----------|-------------------|---------------|
| AT1     | Collect Resources | Retrieve resources from storage. | AND with G2 | Storage | [1, N] | Multiple resources may require multiple robots. |
| AT2     | Deliver Resources | Transport resources to destination. | AND with G3 | Delivery Location | [1, M] | Multiple resources may require multiple robots. |

### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [OR] (#)**
  - **Justification**: Collection and delivery can be performed in parallel by different robots.
  
- **G2 -> AT1, G2.1 [AND] (FALLBACK)** 
  - **Justification**: The collection task must be performed while continuously monitoring the battery level. If the battery drops below 10%, the fallback is triggered.

- **G3 -> AT2, G3.1 [AND] (FALLBACK)**
  - **Justification**: The delivery task must be performed while continuously monitoring the battery level. If the battery drops below 30%, the fallback is triggered.

This model ensures that the mission is executed efficiently, with collection and delivery happening in parallel, and each phase monitoring battery levels to handle potential interruptions gracefully.
